{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"span"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV","text":"Span","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Span","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UTF8","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4UTF8a","text":"UTF8"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF8\/CodeUnit","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO4UTF8O8CodeUnita","text":"CodeUnit"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the case of bridged UTF16 String instances (on Apple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platforms,) this property needs to transcode the code units every time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is called."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, if "},{"code":"string","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has the bridged UTF16 representation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for word in string.split(separator: “ “) {"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"useSpan(word.span)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"}"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is accidentally quadratic because of this issue. A workaround is to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"explicitly convert the string into its native UTF8 representation:","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"var nativeString = consume string","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"nativeString.makeContiguousUTF8()","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for word in nativeString.split(separator: “ “) {","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"useSpan(word.span)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"}","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This second option has linear time complexity, as expected.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns: a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" over the UTF8 code units of this Substring."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complexity: O(1) for native UTF8 Strings, O(n) for bridged UTF16 Strings."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Substring\/UTF8View\/span","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iOS","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"tvOS","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","name":"watchOS","beta":false,"unavailable":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"externalID":"s:Ss8UTF8ViewV4spans4SpanVys5UInt8VGvp","extendedModule":"Swift","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","title":"span","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"span"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","precise